31/apple-just-had-its-best-month-in-a-decade-and-heres-how-to-buy-it-for-less.html", "https://www.benzinga.com/stock/aapl#NASDAQ"], "published": "2018-09-04T03:00:00.000+03:00", "crawled": "2018-09-04T17:32:11.012+03:00", "highlightTitle": ""}